  "historyUrl": "https://hayday.fandom.com/wiki/Duck?action=history",
  "html": "<div class=\"mw-content-ltr mw-parser-output\"><p><br>\n</p>\n<figure class=\"mw-halign-left\"><a href=\"https://static.wikia.nocookie.net/hayday/images/3/38/Duck.png/revision/latest?cb=20150713101647\" class=\"mw-file-description image\" title=\"Duck\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\" target=\"_blank\"><img alt=\"Duck\" loading=\"lazy\" width=\"200\" height=\"200\" class=\"mw-file-element lazyload\" loading=\"lazy\"></a><figcaption>Duck</figcaption></figure>\n<p class=\"mw-empty-elt\">\n</p><section class=\"pi-item pi-group pi-border-color\">\n\t<h2 class=\"pi-item pi-header pi-secondary-font pi-item-spacing pi-secondary-background\"><a href=\"/wiki/animals-3602\" title=\"Animals\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\" target=\"_blank\">Animal</a></h2>\n\n<div class=\"pi-item pi-data pi-item-spacing pi-border-color\">\n\t\n\t<div class=\"pi-data-value pi-font\"><span>xp</span><span title=\"Experience point(s)\"><span class=\"mw-default-size\"><span title=\"xp\"><img alt=\"xp\" src=\"https://static.wikia.nocookie.net/hayday/images/e/e1/Experience.png/revision/latest/scale-to-width-down/25?cb=20160312141717\" loading=\"lazy\" width=\"25\" height=\"25\" class=\"mw-file-element\" loading=\"lazy\"></span></span></span> Exp. lvl(s) 50</div>\n</div>\n\n<div class=\"pi-item pi-data pi-item-spacing pi-border-color\">\n\t\n\t<div class=\"pi-data-value pi-font\"><span>coin</span><span title=\"Coin(s)\"><span class=\"mw-default-size\"><span title=\"coin\"><img alt=\"coin\" src=\"https://static.wikia.nocookie.net/hayday/images/f/f0/Coins.png/revision/latest/scale-to-width-down/25?cb=20160223180814\" loading=\"lazy\" width=\"25\" height=\"25\" class=\"mw-file-element\" loading=\"lazy\"></span></span></span> Free</div>\n</div>\n\n<div class=\"pi-item pi-data pi-item-spacing pi-border-color\">\n\t\n\t\t<h3 class=\"pi-data-label pi-secondary-font\">Gives </h3>\n\t\n\t<div class=\"pi-data-value pi-font\"><span>Duck Feather</span><span title=\"Duck feather(s)\"><span class=\"mw-default-size\"><a href=\"/wiki/duck-feather-17011\" title=\"Duck Feather\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\" target=\"_blank\"><img alt=\"Duck Feather\" src=\"https://static.wikia.nocookie.net/hayday/images/f/f9/Duck_Feather.png/revision/latest/scale-to-width-down/35?cb=20150414212143\" loading=\"lazy\" width=\"35\" height=\"35\" class=\"mw-file-element\" loading=\"lazy\"></a></span></span></div>\n</div>\n\n<div class=\"pi-item pi-data pi-item-spacing pi-border-color\">\n\t\n\t<div class=\"pi-data-value pi-font\"><span>time</span><span title=\"Production/Building time\"><span class=\"mw-default-size\"><span title=\"time\"><img alt=\"time\" loading=\"lazy\" width=\"25\" height=\"25\" class=\"mw-file-element lazyload\" loading=\"lazy\"></span></span></span>  1h to make a trap,<br>2h in water,<br>3h in Salon</div>\n</div>\n\n</section>\n<section class=\"pi-item pi-group pi-border-color pi-collapse pi-collapse-closed\">\n\t<h2 class=\"pi-item pi-header pi-secondary-font pi-item-spacing pi-secondary-background\">+</h2>\n\n<div class=\"pi-item pi-data pi-item-spacing pi-border-color\">\n\t\n\t\t<h3 class=\"pi-data-label pi-secondary-font\">Also: </h3>\n\t\n\t<div class=\"pi-data-value pi-font\"><span>dia</span><span title=\"Diamond(s)\"><span class=\"mw-default-size\"><span title=\"dia\"><img alt=\"dia\" loading=\"lazy\" width=\"25\" height=\"25\" class=\"mw-file-element lazyload\" loading=\"lazy\"></span></span></span> 4 to make a trap,<br>5 in water,<br>6 in Salon</div>\n</div>\n\n</section>\n\n\n<p class=\"mw-empty-elt\"></p><p><b>Ducks</b> are <a href=\"/wiki/animals-3602\" title=\"Animals\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\" target=\"_blank\">animals</a> found in the <a href=\"/wiki/fishing-lake-23340\" title=\"Fishing Lake\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\" target=\"_blank\">fishing lake</a>. They produce <a href=\"/wiki/duck-feather-17011\" title=\"Duck Feather\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\" target=\"_blank\">feathers</a>.\n</p><p>They are unlocked at <a href=\"/wiki/experience-19023\" title=\"Experience\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\" target=\"_blank\">experience</a> level 50 when the <a href=\"/wiki/duck-salon-17003\" title=\"Duck Salon\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\" target=\"_blank\">Duck Salon</a> can be repaired.\n</p>\n<div></div>\n<hr>\n<h3><span class=\"mw-headline\"><b>Appearance</b></span></h3>\n<p>Ducks have three main states: sitting in the salon as they get their hair styled, covered in feathers once their hair is done and flying. They get more varied sitting animations as players upgrade the salon. Unlike other animals, they do not change appearance during seasonal <a href=\"/wiki/themes-25920\" title=\"Themes\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\" target=\"_blank\">themes</a>.\n</p>\n<div class=\"wikia-gallery wikia-gallery-caption-below wikia-gallery-position-left wikia-gallery-spacing-medium wikia-gallery-border-small wikia-gallery-captions-left wikia-gallery-caption-size-medium\"><div class=\"wikia-gallery-caption\"></div><div class=\"wikia-gallery-item\"><div class=\"thumb\"><div class=\"gallery-image-wrapper accent\"><a class=\"image lightbox\" href=\"/unavailable-source?media=File%3ADuck_Ice_Cream.png\" title=\"Duck Ice Cream.png (732 KB)\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\" target=\"_blank\"><img src=\"https://static.wikia.nocookie.net/hayday/images/2/29/Duck_Ice_Cream.png/revision/latest/scale-to-width-down/100?cb=20150713104859\" title=\"Duck Ice Cream.png (732 KB)\" class=\"thumbimage\" alt=\"Initial stage\" height=\"100\" width=\"100\" loading=\"lazy\"><img title=\"Duck Ice Cream.png (732 KB)\" class=\"thumbimage lazyload\" alt=\"Initial stage\" height=\"100\" width=\"100\" loading=\"lazy\"></a></div></div><div class=\"lightbox-caption\">Initial stage</div></div><div class=\"wikia-gallery-item\"><div class=\"thumb\"><div class=\"gallery-image-wrapper accent\"><a class=\"image lightbox\" href=\"/unavailable-source?media=File%3ADuck_Cookie.png\" title=\"Duck Cookie.png (686 KB)\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\" target=\"_blank\"><img src=\"https://static.wikia.nocookie.net/hayday/images/9/98/Duck_Cookie.png/revision/latest/scale-to-width-down/100?cb=20150713104859\" title=\"Duck Cookie.png (686 KB)\" class=\"thumbimage\" alt=\"Stage 2\" height=\"100\" width=\"100\" loading=\"lazy\"><img title=\"Duck Cookie.png (686 KB)\" class=\"thumbimage lazyload\" alt=\"Stage 2\" height=\"100\" width=\"100\" loading=\"lazy\"></a></div></div><div class=\"lightbox-caption\">Stage 2</div></div><div class=\"wikia-gallery-item\"><div class=\"thumb\"><div class=\"gallery-image-wrapper accent\"><a class=\"image lightbox\" href=\"/unavailable-source?media=File%3ADuck_Cucumber.png\" title=\"Duck Cucumber.png (646 KB)\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\" target=\"_blank\"><img src=\"https://static.wikia.nocookie.net/hayday/images/7/79/Duck_Cucumber.png/revision/latest/scale-to-width-down/100?cb=20150713104900\" title=\"Duck Cucumber.png (646 KB)\" class=\"thumbimage\" alt=\"Stage 3\" height=\"100\" width=\"100\" loading=\"lazy\"><img title=\"Duck Cucumber.png (646 KB)\" class=\"thumbimage lazyload\" alt=\"Stage 3\" height=\"100\" width=\"100\" loading=\"lazy\"></a></div></div><div class=\"lightbox-caption\">Stage 3</div></div><div class=\"wikia-gallery-item\"><div class=\"thumb\"><div class=\"gallery-image-wrapper accent\"><a class=\"image lightbox\" href=\"/unavailable-source?media=File%3ADuck_Book.png\" title=\"Duck Book.png (680 KB)\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\" target=\"_blank\"><img src=\"https://static.wikia.nocookie.net/hayday/images/e/e1/Duck_Book.png/revision/latest/scale-to-width-down/100?cb=20150713104859\" title=\"Duck Book.png (680 KB)\" class=\"thumbimage\" alt=\"Stage 4\" height=\"100\" width=\"100\" loading=\"lazy\"><img title=\"Duck Book.png (680 KB)\" class=\"thumbimage lazyload\" alt=\"Stage 4\" height=\"100\" width=\"100\" loading=\"lazy\"></a></div></div><div class=\"lightbox-caption\">Stage 4</div></div><div class=\"wikia-gallery-item\"><div class=\"thumb\"><div class=\"gallery-image-wrapper accent\"><a class=\"image lightbox\" href=\"/unavailable-source?media=File%3ADuck_Cocktail.png\" title=\"Duck Cocktail.png (741 KB)\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\" target=\"_blank\"><img src=\"https://static.wikia.nocookie.net/hayday/images/6/63/Duck_Cocktail.png/revision/latest/scale-to-width-down/100?cb=20150713104900\" title=\"Duck Cocktail.png (741 KB)\" class=\"thumbimage\" alt=\"Stage 5\" height=\"100\" width=\"100\" loading=\"lazy\"><img title=\"Duck Cocktail.png (741 KB)\" class=\"thumbimage lazyload\" alt=\"Stage 5\" height=\"100\" width=\"100\" loading=\"lazy\"></a></div></div><div class=\"lightbox-caption\">Stage 5</div></div><div class=\"wikia-gallery-item\"><div class=\"thumb\"><div class=\"gallery-image-wrapper accent\"><a class=\"image lightbox\" href=\"/unavailable-source?media=File%3ADuck_Bubbles.png\" title=\"Duck Bubbles.png (826 KB)\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\" target=\"_blank\"><img src=\"https://static.wikia.nocookie.net/hayday/images/d/d2/Duck_Bubbles.png/revision/latest/scale-to-width-down/100?cb=20150713104858\" title=\"Duck Bubbles.png (826 KB)\" class=\"thumbimage\" alt=\"Stage 6\" height=\"100\" width=\"100\" loading=\"lazy\"><img title=\"Duck Bubbles.png (826 KB)\" class=\"thumbimage lazyload\" alt=\"Stage 6\" height=\"100\" width=\"100\" loading=\"lazy\"></a></div></div><div class=\"lightbox-caption\">Stage 6</div></div><div class=\"wikia-gallery-item\"><div class=\"thumb\"><div class=\"gallery-image-wrapper accent\"><a class=\"image lightbox\" href=\"/unavailable-source?media=File%3ADuck_ready.png\" title=\"Duck ready.png (163 KB)\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\" target=\"_blank\"><img src=\"https://static.wikia.nocookie.net/hayday/images/d/db/Duck_ready.png/revision/latest/scale-to-width-down/86?cb=20141211054151\" title=\"Duck ready.png (163 KB)\" class=\"thumbimage\" alt=\"Ready to collect duck feather\" height=\"100\" width=\"100\" loading=\"lazy\"><img title=\"Duck ready.png (163 KB)\" class=\"thumbimage lazyload\" alt=\"Ready to collect duck feather\" height=\"100\" width=\"100\" loading=\"lazy\"></a></div></div><div class=\"lightbox-caption\">Ready to collect duck feather</div></div></div>\n<hr>\n<h3><span class=\"mw-headline\"><b>Catching ducks</b></span></h3>\n<figure class=\"mw-halign-left\"><a href=\"https://static.wikia.nocookie.net/hayday/images/7/70/Duck_Trapped.png/revision/latest?cb=20150713101727\" class=\"mw-file-description image\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\" target=\"_blank\"><img alt=\"Duck Trapped\" loading=\"lazy\" width=\"150\" height=\"150\" class=\"mw-file-element lazyload\" loading=\"lazy\"></a><figcaption></figcaption></figure>\n<p>Ducks can be caught with <a href=\"/wiki/duck-trap-17075\" title=\"Duck Trap\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\" target=\"_blank\">duck traps</a>, which is made in the <a href=\"/wiki/net-maker-8475\" title=\"Net Maker\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\" target=\"_blank\">Net Maker</a> for free using 1 hour (or speed up using 4 diamonds). Then, players need to throw a duck trap to a fishing spot and let the duck trap occupy the fishing spot for 2 hours (or speed up using 5 diamonds). After that, ducks must stay in the <a href=\"/wiki/duck-salon-17003\" title=\"Duck Salon\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\" target=\"_blank\">Duck Salon</a> for 3 hours (or speed up using 6 diamonds) before they yield duck feathers. The duck goes back into the water after that.\n</p>\n<div></div>\n<figure class=\"mw-halign-left\"><a href=\"https://static.wikia.nocookie.net/hayday/images/6/67/Duck_Salon_Stage6.png/revision/latest?cb=20150713112815\" class=\"mw-file-description image\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\" target=\"_blank\"><img alt=\"Duck Salon Stage6\" loading=\"lazy\" width=\"150\" height=\"150\" class=\"mw-file-element lazyload\" loading=\"lazy\"></a><figcaption></figcaption></figure>\n<p>The <a href=\"/wiki/duck-salon-17003\" title=\"Duck Salon\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\" target=\"_blank\">salon</a> can initially welcome only one duck. Players can upgrade it using <a href=\"/wiki/coin-6079\" title=\"Coin\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\" target=\"_blank\">coins</a> and time to make room for more ducks (to a maximum of six ducks). \n</p>\n<div></div>\n<hr>\n<p><br>\n</p>\n<div class=\"navmenutitle\">See also</div><div class=\"navmenubox\">\n<div class=\"wikia-gallery wikia-gallery-caption-below wikia-gallery-position-center wikia-gallery-spacing-small wikia-gallery-border-none wikia-gallery-captions-center wikia-gallery-caption-size-medium\"><div class=\"wikia-gallery-caption\"></div><div class=\"wikia-gallery-item\"><div class=\"thumb\"><div class=\"gallery-image-wrapper\"><a class=\"image link-internal\" href=\"/wiki/chicken-2409\" title=\"Chicken (213 KB)\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\" target=\"_blank\"><img src=\"https://static.wikia.nocookie.net/hayday/images/a/a3/Chicken.png/revision/latest/scale-to-width-down/50?cb=20191025192121\" title=\"Chicken (213 KB)\" class=\"thumbimage\" alt=\"\" height=\"50\" width=\"50\" loading=\"lazy\"><img title=\"Chicken (213 KB)\" class=\"thumbimage lazyload\" alt=\"\" height=\"50\" width=\"50\" loading=\"lazy\"></a></div></div></div><div class=\"wikia-gallery-item\"><div class=\"thumb\"><div class=\"gallery-image-wrapper\"><a class=\"image link-internal\" href=\"/wiki/cow-2488\" title=\"Cow (241 KB)\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\" target=\"_blank\"><img src=\"https://static.wikia.nocookie.net/hayday/images/8/84/Cow.png/revision/latest/scale-to-width-down/50?cb=20191025194659\" title=\"Cow (241 KB)\" class=\"thumbimage\" alt=\"\" height=\"50\" width=\"50\" loading=\"lazy\"><img title=\"Cow (241 KB)\" class=\"thumbimage lazyload\" alt=\"\" height=\"50\" width=\"50\" loading=\"lazy\"></a></div></div></div><div class=\"wikia-gallery-item\"><div class=\"thumb\"><div class=\"gallery-image-wrapper\"><a class=\"image link-internal\" href=\"/wiki/duck-16989\" title=\"Duck (806 KB)\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\" target=\"_blank\"><img src=\"https://static.wikia.nocookie.net/hayday/images/3/38/Duck.png/revision/latest/scale-to-width-down/50?cb=20150713101647\" title=\"Duck (806 KB)\" class=\"thumbimage\" alt=\"\" height=\"50\" width=\"50\" loading=\"lazy\"><img title=\"Duck (806 KB)\" class=\"thumbimage lazyload\" alt=\"\" height=\"50\" width=\"50\" loading=\"lazy\"></a></div></div></div><div class=\"wikia-gallery-item\"><div class=\"thumb\"><div class=\"gallery-image-wrapper\"><a class=\"image link-internal\" href=\"/wiki/fish-5891\" title=\"Fish (224 KB)\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\" target=\"_blank\"><img src=\"https://static.wikia.nocookie.net/hayday/images/f/f8/Sockeye_Salmon.png/revision/latest/scale-to-width-down/50?cb=20150711153706\" title=\"Fish (224 KB)\" class=\"thumbimage\" alt=\"\" height=\"50\" width=\"50\" loading=\"lazy\"><img title=\"Fish (224 KB)\" class=\"thumbimage lazyload\" alt=\"\" height=\"50\" width=\"50\" loading=\"lazy\"></a></div></div></div><div class=\"wikia-gallery-item\"><div class=\"thumb\"><div class=\"gallery-image-wrapper\"><a class=\"image link-internal\" href=\"/wiki/goat-2346\" title=\"Goat (319 KB)\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\" target=\"_blank\"><img src=\"https://static.wikia.nocookie.net/hayday/images/5/52/Goat.png/revision/latest/scale-to-width-down/50?cb=20191025202216\" title=\"Goat (319 KB)\" class=\"thumbimage\" alt=\"\" height=\"50\" width=\"50\" loading=\"lazy\"><img title=\"Goat (319 KB)\" class=\"thumbimage lazyload\" alt=\"\" height=\"50\" width=\"50\" loading=\"lazy\"></a></div></div></div><div class=\"wikia-gallery-item\"><div class=\"thumb\"><div class=\"gallery-image-wrapper\"><a class=\"image link-internal\" href=\"/wiki/honey-bee-15814\" title=\"Honey Bee (160 KB)\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\" target=\"_blank\"><img src=\"https://static.wikia.nocookie.net/hayday/images/c/c3/Honey_Bee.png/revision/latest/scale-to-width-down/50?cb=20191025204515\" title=\"Honey Bee (160 KB)\" class=\"thumbimage\" alt=\"\" height=\"50\" width=\"50\" loading=\"lazy\"><img title=\"Honey Bee (160 KB)\" class=\"thumbimage lazyload\" alt=\"\" height=\"50\" width=\"50\" loading=\"lazy\"></a></div></div></div><div class=\"wikia-gallery-item\"><div class=\"thumb\"><div class=\"gallery-image-wrapper\"><a class=\"image link-internal\" href=\"/wiki/lamb-36739\" title=\"Lamb (398 KB)\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\" target=\"_blank\"><img src=\"https://static.wikia.nocookie.net/hayday/images/5/56/Lamb.png/revision/latest/scale-to-width-down/49?cb=20260510122300\" title=\"Lamb (398 KB)\" class=\"thumbimage\" alt=\"\" height=\"50\" width=\"50\" loading=\"lazy\"><img title=\"Lamb (398 KB)\" class=\"thumbimage lazyload\" alt=\"\" height=\"50\" width=\"50\" loading=\"lazy\"></a></div></div></div><div class=\"wikia-gallery-item\"><div class=\"thumb\"><div class=\"gallery-image-wrapper\"><a class=\"image link-internal\" href=\"/wiki/lobster-16889\" title=\"Lobster (212 KB)\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\" target=\"_blank\"><img src=\"https://static.wikia.nocookie.net/hayday/images/9/9f/Lobster.png/revision/latest/scale-to-width-down/50?cb=20150713102226\" title=\"Lobster (212 KB)\" class=\"thumbimage\" alt=\"\" height=\"50\" width=\"50\" loading=\"lazy\"><img title=\"Lobster (212 KB)\" class=\"thumbimage lazyload\" alt=\"\" height=\"50\" width=\"50\" loading=\"lazy\"></a></div></div></div><div class=\"wikia-gallery-item\"><div class=\"thumb\"><div class=\"gallery-image-wrapper\"><a class=\"image link-internal\" href=\"/wiki/pig-2491\" title=\"Pig (126 KB)\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\" target=\"_blank\"><img src=\"https://static.wikia.nocookie.net/hayday/images/3/30/Pig.png/revision/latest/scale-to-width-down/50?cb=20191025201248\" title=\"Pig (126 KB)\" class=\"thumbimage\" alt=\"\" height=\"50\" width=\"50\" loading=\"lazy\"><img title=\"Pig (126 KB)\" class=\"thumbimage lazyload\" alt=\"\" height=\"50\" width=\"50\" loading=\"lazy\"></a></div></div></div><div class=\"wikia-gallery-item\"><div class=\"thumb\"><div class=\"gallery-image-wrapper\"><a class=\"image link-internal\" href=\"/wiki/sheep-2350\" title=\"Sheep (137 KB)\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\" target=\"_blank\"><img src=\"https://static.wikia.nocookie.net/hayday/images/c/cc/Sheep.png/revision/latest/scale-to-width-down/50?cb=20191025203649\" title=\"Sheep (137 KB)\" class=\"thumbimage\" alt=\"\" height=\"50\" width=\"50\" loading=\"lazy\"><img title=\"Sheep (137 KB)\" class=\"thumbimage lazyload\" alt=\"\" height=\"50\" width=\"50\" loading=\"lazy\"></a></div></div></div><div class=\"wikia-gallery-item\"><div class=\"thumb\"><div class=\"gallery-image-wrapper\"><a class=\"image link-internal\" href=\"/wiki/squirrel-34000\" title=\"Squirrel (182 KB)\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\" target=\"_blank\"><img src=\"https://static.wikia.nocookie.net/hayday/images/4/41/Squirrel.png/revision/latest/scale-to-width-down/50?cb=20200707053020\" title=\"Squirrel (182 KB)\" class=\"thumbimage\" alt=\"\" height=\"50\" width=\"50\" loading=\"lazy\"><img title=\"Squirrel (182 KB)\" class=\"thumbimage lazyload\" alt=\"\" height=\"50\" width=\"50\" loading=\"lazy\"></a></div></div></div></div></div>\n<table>\n<tbody><tr>\n<td>\n</td>\n<td>\n</td>\n<td>\n</td>\n<td>\n</td>\n<td>\n</td>\n<td>\n</td>\n<td>\n</td>\n<td>\n</td>\n<td>\n</td>\n<td>\n</td>\n<td>\n</td>\n<td>\n</td>\n<td>\n</td>\n<td>\n</td>\n<td>\n</td></tr></tbody></table>\n<!-- \nNewPP limit report\nCached time: 20260830184520\nCache expiry: 1209600\nReduced expiry: false\nComplications: [no‐toc]\nCPU time usage: 0.072 seconds\nReal time usage: 0.095 seconds\nPreprocessor visited node count: 344/1000000\nPost‐expand include size: 2519/2097152 bytes\nTemplate argument size: 175/2097152 bytes\nHighest expansion depth: 5/100\nExpensive parser function count: 0/100\nUnstrip recursion depth: 0/20\nUnstrip post‐expand size: 21110/5000000 bytes\nExtLoops count: 0/200\nLua time usage: 0.007/7.000 seconds\nLua memory usage: 766007/104857600 bytes\n-->\n<!--\nTransclusion expansion time report (%,ms,calls,template)\n100.00%   77.978      1 -total\n 61.13%   47.667      1 Template:Infobox\n 29.80%   23.237      5 Templa